	(text "Power input OR-ing: USB VBUS (via D3) and the DC jack J2 (via D4)\nboth feed VIN through Schottky diodes, so neither supply can\nback-feed the other when both are plugged in.\nJack input must be 5 V DC (U2 max input 5.5 V). J2 is not populated by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 180.34 0)
		(effects
